WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,850
Sir, do you need me to do anything for you?

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:08,660
Sir, are you kidding? No

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:15,510
Because I'm just a female cousin

4
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:18,670
I can kiss anyone who gives me money without hesitation

5
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:19,870
What's a kiss?

6
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:22,870
The man once asked me to perform a kissing show with his bodyguard in public

7
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:25,470
One hundred thousand for a kiss, I earned it

8
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,270
That’s it for today

9
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:30,320
See Miss, see you next time

10
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:35,590
Does he really want just a kiss? No

11
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:39,720
What he bought was how twisted and struggling human nature is

12
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:45,150
But I also feel pain, so there is no dignity left

13
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,750
Female cousins also have dignity

14
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,560
Only I don't

15
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,160
I'm just a cousin

16
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:54,160
I will tear off this protective layer with my own hands
